    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zui's Witch Academy is a boss rush roguelike-styled action game. You build a deck of 3 magical cards to take down one of many bosses. Each boss has an arena specifically tailored to them. Can you help Rysa graduate from Zui's Witch Academy with flying colors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was originally made for the Boss Rush 2025 Game Jam!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603660/extras/99f1b4b9429705c51c31059d773466b0.poster.avif?t=1743891015\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603660/extras/99f1b4b9429705c51c31059d773466b0.apng?t=1743891015\" class=\"bb_img\" width=58 height=44 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 unique cards to collect and build your deck with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulties to attempt and conquer, I doubt you can beat impossible mode (no like seriously, give up).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice and master against every boss in training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 bosses each with their own arena specifically designed around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic and fun soundtrack! Complemented by a charming modern pixel-art aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is free! Download it and play it now! Rysa is waitin' for you to wake her up, how else is she going to graduate from Zui's Witch Academy?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zui's Witch Academy is a boss rush roguelike-styled action game. You build a deck of 3 magical cards to take down one of many bosses. Each boss has an arena specifically tailored to them. Can you help Rysa graduate from Zui's Witch Academy with flying colors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was originally made for the Boss Rush 2025 Game Jam!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603660/extras/99f1b4b9429705c51c31059d773466b0.poster.avif?t=1743891015\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603660/extras/99f1b4b9429705c51c31059d773466b0.apng?t=1743891015\" class=\"bb_img\" width=58 height=44 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 unique cards to collect and build your deck with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulties to attempt and conquer, I doubt you can beat impossible mode (no like seriously, give up).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice and master against every boss in training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 bosses each with their own arena specifically designed around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic and fun soundtrack! Complemented by a charming modern pixel-art aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is free! Download it and play it now! Rysa is waitin' for you to wake her up, how else is she going to graduate from Zui's Witch Academy?</p>",
